  "descriptionModule": {
   "briefSummary": "To assess the effect of treatment with Glycopyronnium (GP) MDI administered twice daily (BID) and Formoterol Fumarate (FF) MDI administered BID on specific image-based airway volumes and resistance in subjects with moderate to severe chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD) following chronic dosing after approximately two weeks treatment."
  },
